        "Then continue."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "markdown_link",
      "input": "See [the record](https://example.test/a.b). Continue here.",
      "expected": [
        "See [the record](https://example.test/a.b).",
        "Continue here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "colon",
      "input": "Rules: first preserve evidence. Then evaluate the claim.",
